bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    jit_u8_repeat_literal_copy_push_leak_2026-11-27, 0, "Seed JIT: a [u8] built as a [0u8; n] repeat literal plus index stores, then copied (var r: [u8] = a) and pushed onto, grows RSS faster per call than the same buffer built with push. PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 20000 iterations: 172 MB vs 131-137 MB."

