    jit_u8_repeat_literal_copy_push_leak_2026-11-27, P3, open, "Seed JIT: [0u8; n] copied then pushed leaks more than a push-built [u8]", doc/08_tracking/bug/jit_u8_repeat_literal_copy_push_leak_2026-11-27.md, 1, doc/08_tracking/bug/jit_u8_repeat_literal_copy_push_leak_2026-11-27.md, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    jit_u8_repeat_literal_copy_push_leak_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 measured on aarch64 DGX with seed cargo-target-wr-seed1126b, SIMPLE_EXECUTION_MODE=jit; iterations=1 gives 94 MB on both shapes, so the difference is per call. Workaround: src/lib/common/crypto/pbkdf2.spl _pbkdf2_u8_pad builds ipad/opad with push."
